.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH snip-search 1  "snip 0.5.5" 
.SH NAME
snip\-search \- Search titles, tags, notes, and fragment content
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnip search\fR [\fB\-\-library\fR] [\fB\-\-regex\fR] [\fB\-\-folder\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-subfolders\fR] [\fB\-\-simplified\-ui\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-field\fR] [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-context\fR] [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search titles, tags, notes, and fragment content
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-library\fR \fI<LIBRARY>\fR
Library root. Falls back to SNIP_LIBRARY, ancestor discovery, then config
.TP
\fB\-\-regex\fR
Treat QUERY as a regular expression. Case\-insensitive; use (?\-i) to opt out
.TP
\fB\-\-folder\fR \fI<FOLDER>\fR
Restrict to a folder and its subfolders. Pass "" for Uncategorized
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Structured output mode for commands that return records
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
jsonl
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR
Color policy for terminal preview
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-subfolders\fR
Restrict \-\-folder to that folder alone, excluding its subfolders
.TP
\fB\-\-simplified\-ui\fR[=\fI<BOOL>\fR]
Use square TUI bars without Powerline font glyphs for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-field\fR \fI<FIELDS>\fR
Only search these parts of a snippet. Repeatable; defaults to all
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
title
.IP \(bu 2
tag
.IP \(bu 2
readme
.IP \(bu 2
content
.IP \(bu 2
note
.RE
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-context\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 0]
Lines of surrounding context to include with each match
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<N>\fR
Keep only the top N results after scoring
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>

